            "Photosynthesis, Calvin cycle, sugar production"),

        ["vacuole"] = new("Central Vacuole", "Water-filled storage",
            "A huge fluid-filled sac that stores water, ions, and waste, and presses against the cell wall to keep the plant rigid.",
